{"ref":"BDB, תֹּ֫עוּ","hw":"תֹּ֫עוּ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">תֹּ֫עוּ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תֹּ֫עִי</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> king of Hamath, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:9\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.9\">2 S 8:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:10\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.10\">10</a><sup>(×2)</sup> = <span dir=\"rtl\">תֹּ֫עוּ</span> (which We Dr al. prefer) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.9\">1 Ch 18:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.10\">10</a>.","next":"BDB, תְּעָלָה³","prev":"BDB, תְּעוּדָה²"}